# LISD Brand Design System

This tool is an official LISD internal staff application. Every visual decision must match the Lewisville ISD brand identity as confirmed from the live LISD style guide (lisd.net/production2). Staff who use this tool also use official LISD websites daily — the UI must look like it belongs to the same organization.

## Color Tokens — confirmed from LISD CMS source CSS, use exactly

```css
/* Primary brand — from :root CSS variables on lisd.net */
--lisd-navy:        #073772;   /* --primary-color: the dominant brand color; headers, card surfaces, nav bars, active states */
--lisd-gold:        #f1b51c;   /* --secondary-color: accent only — highlights, focus rings, badge indicators; never large fills */

/* Interactive blues — from CMS component styles */
--lisd-blue-mid:    #254A95;   /* interactive blue used in chat bubbles and links on dark backgrounds */
--lisd-blue-link:   #3366CC;   /* hyperlink color on white backgrounds */
--lisd-blue-hover:  #122C4B;   /* hover state for dark buttons */

/* Neutrals — from CMS named color map */
--lisd-dark:        #102738;   /* dark blue-black for heading text on light backgrounds */
--lisd-gray-body:   #3a3a3a;   /* body text color on white */
--lisd-gray-mid:    #595959;   /* secondary/muted text */
--lisd-gray-border: #D4D8E1;   /* input borders and card borders (named: input-border) */
--lisd-gray-light:  #F1F4F6;   /* page background (named: lightest-gray) */
--lisd-white:       #FFFFFF;   /* card surfaces, text on dark backgrounds */

/* Status — from CMS alert/error styles */
--lisd-green:       #0b6e27;   /* success text and left-border accents */
--lisd-error:       #B63D4B;   /* error text */
--lisd-error-bg:    #CF4656;   /* error badges and destructive button backgrounds */
--lisd-warning:     #E57200;   /* warning states */
```

## Typography

**Primary font stack (always use this order):**
```css
font-family: Arial, "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, sans-serif;
```

The LISD CMS uses `proxima-nova` (Adobe licensed) but this is unavailable on LISD Windows machines without a separate install. The CMS fallback chain is `"Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif`. For a local Windows tool, lead with `Arial` since it is guaranteed present.

Rules:
- Never use Inter, Roboto, Open Sans, Lato, Montserrat, or any CDN font import
- Never use `system-ui` or `-apple-system` — this runs on Windows only
- Monospace (asset tags, serials, ticket numbers): `"Courier New", Courier, monospace`
- Heading weight: bold (700). Body weight: regular (400). Labels: 400 or 500.

## Layout

- Page background: `--lisd-gray-light` (#F1F4F6)
- Each workflow = one centered card, white surface, max-width 480px for intake forms
- Card has 4px top border accent in `--lisd-navy`, 1px border `--lisd-gray-border`, border-radius 4px
- Internal card padding: 32px top/bottom, 32px left/right
- 8px base grid for all spacing
- No sidebar, no tabs, no navigation — single-purpose per screen

## Component Specs

**Inputs:**
- Border: 1px solid `--lisd-gray-border` (#D4D8E1); focused: 2px solid `--lisd-blue-link` (#3366CC)
- Background: `--lisd-white`; label above, `--lisd-gray-body`, Arial 13px font-weight 500
- Height: 40px; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0 12px

**Primary button (Run Intake, Submit):**
- Background: `--lisd-navy` (#073772); text: `--lisd-white`; Arial bold 14px; letter-spacing: 0.02em
- Hover: `--lisd-blue-hover` (#122C4B)
- Disabled: `--lisd-gray-border` background, `--lisd-gray-mid` text, cursor: not-allowed, opacity: 0.6
- Height: 40px; border-radius: 4px; no extra box-shadow

**Header bar:**
- Background: `--lisd-navy` (#073772); text: white; height: 48px
- Left-aligned logo (supplied separately) with 16px horizontal padding
- No navigation links

**Status area:**
- Arial 13px, `--lisd-gray-body`; inline text updates, no animation
- Success: 3px left border `--lisd-green` (#0b6e27), background rgba(11,110,39,0.06)
- Error: 3px left border `--lisd-error` (#B63D4B), background rgba(182,61,75,0.06)

**Gold accent usage (`--lisd-gold` #f1b51c):**
- Use only for small UI signals: focus ring on the asset tag input (the scanner target), active field indicator
- Never use as a button background or large fill
- Always pair with `--lisd-navy` or `--lisd-dark` text for contrast

## Accessibility

- All text on `--lisd-navy` backgrounds must use `--lisd-white` — confirmed 5:1+ contrast ratio
- All interactive elements must have visible focus state — never `outline: none` without a visible replacement
- Every input must have an explicit `<label for="">` — no placeholder-as-label
- Color alone never conveys state — always pair with a text label

## Do not do

- No Google Fonts or any CDN font import whatsoever
- No CSS animations or transitions on status text — plain DOM text updates only
- No gradients on the primary card surface
- No border-radius larger than 4px on card or inputs (LISD visual language is clean and rectilinear)
- No use of `--lisd-gold` for large backgrounds or primary actions
